I walk over to Nele's desk.
We are now working together on the new project.
She is the designer on the team.
"Hello Maya," Nele says and smiles.
"Do you need the images for the project?"
"Yes, exactly," I answer.
We talk a bit about our work.
"I have worked here for five years," Nele explains.
That is a long time!
We look at her large monitor.
"I have made the design for the homepage," she says.
She shows me the layout.
"That looks very good," I say.
"Have you already finished the other pages too?"
"Not quite yet," Nele answers.
"I have chosen the colors."
"But I still need time for the details."
"No problem," I say.
"I will just start with the homepage."
